          ],
          "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array} { c } 8 0 x _ { A } + 9 0 x _ { B } + 8 5 x _ { C } \\leq 3 2 0 0 0 * 1 0 0 0 \\\\ 2 5 x _ { B } \\leq 6 0 0 0 * 1 0 0 0 \\\\ 1 0 x _ { A } + 8 x _ { B } + 3 x _ { C } \\leq 2 4 0 0 * 1 0 0 0 \\\\ x _ { A } + x _ { B } \\leq 7 0 0 0 \\\\ x _ { C } \\geq 0 . 4 x _ { A } \\\\ x _ { A } , x _ { B } , x _ { C } \\geq 0 \\\\ x _ { A } , x _ { B } , x _ { C } \\in \\mathbb { Z } \\end{array} \\right."
