        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.451,
            0.652,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "总完成时刻变化为: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left( C _ { i } + C _ { j } \\right) - \\left( C _ { i } ^ { \\prime } + C _ { j } ^ { \\prime } \\right) = p _ { i } - p _ { j } > 0  。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.475,
            0.88,
            0.519
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "因此，将 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\overline { { \\cdot } } p _ { j } < p _ { i }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的任务交换到前面，会减少总完成时间。不断进行这样的交换操作，最终会得到最小的平均完成时刻调度—即按照 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "i p _ { i }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的不增顺序排序。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.523,
            0.542,
            0.542
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "整体复杂度由排序部分决定，为0(nlgn)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.562,
            0.287,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "16.（共12分）解:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.586,
            0.894,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "本题可建模为将航行计划按出发时的坐标排序，然后力求使得到达坐标中单调上升的序列长度尽可能长，因此是问题转换为最长上升子序列问题，n减去求得的最长上升子序列长度即为最少的去除方案。 (至此 5 分)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.656,
            0.345,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "参考伪代码如下所示。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.68,
            0.59,
            0.919
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "code_body",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.68,
                0.59,
                0.919
              ],
              "content": "MIN-REMOVE(plan)\n1. sort plan by its start time\n2. initialize f[1..n] with 1\n3. for i = 1 to n do\n4. for j = 1 to i−1 do\n5. if plan[j].end < plan[i].end then\n6. f[i] ← max(f[i], f[j]+1)\n7. maxn ←f[1]\n8. for i = 2 to n do\n9. maxn ← max(maxn, f[i])\n10. return n-maxn"
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "guess_lang": "txt"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.48,
            0.918,
            0.518,
            0.931
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3/4"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
